                    {
                        "form_id": "ad17e4cd-fb94-4602-b576-db8aa09612fd",
                        "entry_id": "e993183e-4864-3d69-b7fc-37bda6cf28a0",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "effed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fec955ff-9b11-3b6c-8f60-56f758be8f2b",
                        "entry_id": "e993183e-4864-3d69-b7fc-37bda6cf28a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To put into words; to express."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b85c68d-f787-4c5e-80cb-7c209cc741a1",
                                "sense_id": "fec955ff-9b11-3b6c-8f60-56f758be8f2b",
                                "text": "[…] and perhaps also because what we know partakes in no small measure of the nature of what has so happily been called the unutterable or ineffable, so that any attempt to utter or eff it is doomed to fail, doomed, doomed to fail."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be1eef70-1310-40ab-94bf-7b12b39050f0",
                                "sense_id": "fec955ff-9b11-3b6c-8f60-56f758be8f2b",
                                "text": "They, no more than we, found it hard to eff the ineffable, but they, you see, needed to console themselves more."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d80d67a-da38-4bb5-b317-85b691099bd1",
                                "sense_id": "fec955ff-9b11-3b6c-8f60-56f758be8f2b",
                                "text": "It is another way of effing the ineffable, one with potentially serious practical effects."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5101ea94-8c75-4355-9aa9-59a67c37a70b",
                                "sense_id": "fec955ff-9b11-3b6c-8f60-56f758be8f2b",
                                "text": "Douglas Adams (1952–2001), author of The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy, puts it memorably: “Let's think the unthinkable, let's do the undoable. Let us prepare to grapple with the ineffable itself, and see if we may not eff it after all.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
